<title>GERMANY: Buba revises down Mar Pan-German industry orders.</title>
<headline>Buba revises down Mar Pan-German industry orders.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS   Mar 97	   Feb 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.9	     unch</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.7	     +5.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    99.5 (99.7)    98.6</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.5	     -0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.1	     +5.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    97.5 (97.6)    97.0</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +6.9	     +4.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		  +19.5	     +6.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   149.0 (150.4)  139.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
